sentences.text:
4. Therefore, in view of the facts and .
circumstances of the case, as the investigation is complete and nothing remains to be recovered from the petitioner, coupled with the fact that his custodial interrogation is not required, the present bail application is allowed and the interim order dated 15.03.2023 is made absolute, subject to the following conditions:-
(i) that the petitioner will appear before the Court and the Investigating Officer whenever required;
(ii) that he will not directly or indirectly make any inducement, threat or promise to any person acquainted with the facts of the case so as to dissuade him/her from disclosing any facts to the Court or the police;
Roshan Lal vs . State Of Hp on 20 April, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/6116530/
1 (iii) that he will not tamper with the prosecution evidence nor he will try to win over the Prosecution witnesses or terrorise them in any manner;
(iv) that he will not leave India without prior permission of the Court.

